  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1c48f655d92fd4db296dc049bfbb1ede, type: 3}
  itemDescription: "Earth and Space Science Institute: Eyes on Earth: Developing
    the Arabic Earth Now Platform  This unique institute bridges earth sciences and
    space sciences. Its mission includes conducting astronomy and astrophysics research,
    as well as Earth observation science (using satellite data to study Earth\u2019s
    atmosphere, geology, and oceans). Focus areas include supporting Saudi involvement
    in international astronomy (e.g. observing celestial events, operating telescopes),
    studying planetary science and astrophysics, and analyzing satellite remote sensing
    data for Earth system monitoring. The institute often provides scientific expertise
    for national initiatives (like the Space Commission\u2019s educational programs
    or geological surveys from space). It aims to advance fundamental knowledge of
    the universe and apply space-based data to benefit Earth (for example, in geology
    or meteorology)"
